        <Literal>Variation affecting protein motif of four consecutive residues that may contain one H-bond, which, if present, is between the main-chain CO of the first residue and the main-chain NH of the fourth. It is characterized by the dihedral angles of the second and third residues, which is used to sub-categorize the turns.</Literal>
