        <Literal>The phenotype resulting from genetic perturbation of A has an effect only in the b background, or the b variant has an effect only in the a background. A has an effect only in the b background, or the b variant has an effect only in the a background. E. g., WT = a &gt; ab &gt; b or WT &gt; a &gt; b &gt; ab.</Literal>
